            <ArticleTitle>Prognostic factors of sciatica in the Canon of Avicenna.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3095-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s00296-012-2574-2</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Prognosis studies are fast developing and very practical types of medical research. Sciatica is one of the common types of low back pain and identifying prognostic factors of the illness can help physicians and patients to choose best method of practice. The prognostic factors of sciatica are presented from the Canon of Avicenna, one of the most famous physicians in the history of medicine.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
